  "title": "Precomputed place statistics",
  "description": "Precomputed statistics of ERDDAP grid variables over the gazetteer places: one Parquet file per (dataset, variable, place), covering the last 365 days (or the dataset's full extent if shorter). Each file is produced by exactly the code the browser app runs live — the place polygon masks the dataset's own grid (cell centre inside, partial-area weight on the boundary) and sql/stats_daily.sql or sql/stats_categorical.sql aggregates per day — so a precomputed row and a live in-browser row agree. Use these when you want the answer now; run the live query when you want today.",
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "keywords": [
    "statistics",
    "time series",
    "marine protected areas",
    "ERDDAP",
    "griddap",
    "zonal statistics"
  ],
